{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"春秋之法，王姬下嫁書於策，以魯公同姓之國為之婚主故爾。古者，婦諱不出門，內言不出梱。公主悉列於傳，非禮也。然遼國專任外戚，公主多見紀、傳間，不得不表見之。禮，男女異長，不當與皇子同列，別為公主附表。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"太祖一女：","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"質古。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁淳欽皇后弟蕭室魯。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"幼為奧姑。契丹故俗，凡婚燕之禮，推女子之可尊敬者坐於奧，謂之「奧姑。」","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"未封而卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"太宗二女：","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"呂不古，第一。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"應曆間，封汧國長公主。保寧中，進封燕國大長公主。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁北府宰相蕭思溫。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"以疾薨。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"嘲瑰，第二。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁北府宰相蕭海璃。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"應曆初，未封卒。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"世宗三女：","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"懷節皇后生：","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_18","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"和古典，第一。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_19","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"保寧間，封秦國長公主。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_20","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁侍中蕭啜里。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_21","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"以疾薨。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_22","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"觀音，第二。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_23","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"保寧間，封晉國長公主。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_24","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭夏剌。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_25","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"撒剌，第三。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_26","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭斡里。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_27","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"未封卒。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_28","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"景宗四女：","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_29","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"睿智皇后生三女","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_30","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"觀音女，第一。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_31","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封魏國公主，進封齊國。景福中，封燕國大長公主。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_32","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁北府宰相蕭繼先。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_33","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"皇后尤加愛，賜奴婢萬口。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_34","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"重熙中薨。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_35","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"長壽女，第二。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_36","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封吳國公主。統和初，進封衛國，改封魏國長公主。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_37","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁宰相蕭排押。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_38","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"開泰六年薨。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_39","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"延壽女，第三。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_40","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封越國公主，追封趙國。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_41","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭恆德。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_42","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"性沉厚，睿智皇後於諸女尤愛。甚得婦道，不以貴寵自驕。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_43","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"年二十一，以疾薨。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_44","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"渤海妃生一女：","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_45","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"淑哥，第四。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_46","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"無封號。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_47","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"乾亨二年，下嫁盧俊。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_48","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"與駙馬都尉盧俊不諧，表請離婚，改適蕭神奴。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_49","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"聖宗十四女：","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_50","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"貴妃生一女：","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_51","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"燕哥，第一。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_52","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封隨國公主，進封秦國。興宗封宋國長公主。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_53","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭匹里。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_54","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"欽哀皇后生二女：","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_55","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"巖母菫，第二。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_56","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"開泰七年，封魏國公主。進封秦國長公主，改封秦晉國長公主。清寧初，加大長公主。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_57","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭啜不。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_58","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"改適蕭海里，不諧，離之。又適蕭胡睹，不諧，離之，乃適韓國王蕭惠。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_59","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"槊古，第三。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_60","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封越國公主，進封晉國。景福初，封晉蜀國長公主。清寧初，加大長公主。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_61","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭孝忠。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_62","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"姿質秀麗，禮法自將。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_63","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"以疾薨。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_64","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"蕭氏生二女：蕭氏，國舅夷離畢房之女。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_65","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"崔八，第四。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_66","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封南陽郡主進封公主。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_67","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭孝先。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_68","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"太平末，東京大延琳反，遇害。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_69","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"陶哥，第五。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_70","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封長寧郡主，進封公主。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_71","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭楊六。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_72","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"蕭氏生一女：","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_73","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"鈿匿，第六。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_74","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封平原郡主，進封荊國公主。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_75","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭雙古。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_76","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"馬氏生一女：","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_77","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"九哥，第七。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_78","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封潯陽郡主，進封公主。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_79","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭璉。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_80","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"大氏生一女：","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_81","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"長壽，第八。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_82","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封臨海郡主，進封公主。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_83","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁大力秋","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_84","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"駙馬都尉大力秋坐大延琳事伏誅，改適蕭慥古。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_85","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"白氏生四女：","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_86","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"八哥，第九。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_87","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封同昌縣主，進封公主。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_88","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁劉三嘏。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_89","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"十哥，第十。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_90","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封三河郡主，進封公主。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_91","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁奚王蕭高九。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_92","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"擘失，第十一。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_93","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封仁壽縣主，進封公主。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_94","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁劉四端。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_95","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"泰哥，第十二。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_96","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭忽烈。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_97","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"李氏生一女：","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_98","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"賽哥，第十三。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_99","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封金鄉郡主，進封公主。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_100","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"統和中，下嫁蕭圖玉。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_101","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"以殺奴婢，得罪。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_102","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"薨於貶所。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_103","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"艾氏生一女：","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_104","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"興哥，第十四。","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_105","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭王六。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_106","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"興宗二女：","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_107","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"仁懿皇后生二女：","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_108","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"跋芹，第一。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_109","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封魏國公主。重熙末，徙封晉國，加長公主。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_110","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭撒八。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_111","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"與駙馬都尉蕭撒八不諧，離之。清寧初，改適蕭阿速。以婦道不修，徙中京，又嫁蕭窩匿。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_112","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"斡里太，第二。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_113","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封鄭國公主。清寧間，加長公主。壽隆間，加大長公主。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_114","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭余里也。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_115","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"道宗三女：","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_116","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"宣懿皇后生三女：","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_117","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"撒葛只，第一。","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_118","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封鄭國公主。咸雍中，徙封魏國。","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_119","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭末。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_120","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"端麗有智。","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_121","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"大康初薨。","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_122","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"糾里，第二。","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_123","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封齊國公主，進封趙國。","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_124","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭撻不也。","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_125","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"駙馬都尉撻不也坐昭懷太子事被害，其弟訛都斡欲逼尚公主，公主以訛都斡黨乙辛，惡之。未幾，訛都斡以事伏誅。天祚幼，乙辛用事。公主每以匡救為心，竟誅乙辛。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_126","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"大安五年，以疾薨。","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_127","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"特里，第三。","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_128","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封越國公主。乾統初，進封秦晉國大長公主。徙封梁宋國大長公主。","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_129","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭酬斡。","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_130","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"公主從天祚出奔。明年，攻應州，留公主守輜重。金人圍之，公主奔行在所，天祚潛遁，為金人所獲。","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_131","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"大康八年，以駙馬都尉蕭酬斡得罪，離之。大安初，改適蕭特末。為都統，與金人戰，敗於石輦鐸，被擒。","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_132","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"昭懷太子一女：","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_133","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"延壽。","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_134","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封楚國公主，徙封許國。乾統元年，進封趙國，加秦晉國長公主。","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_135","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"下嫁蕭韓家奴。","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_136","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"幼遭乙辛之難，與兄天祚俱養於蕭懷忠家。後李氏進挾穀歌，文帝感悟，召還宮。","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_137","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"天祚六女：","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_138","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"文妃生一女：","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_139","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"余里衍。","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_140","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"封蜀國公主。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_141","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"為金人所獲。","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_142","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"元妃生三女：","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_143","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"俱為金人所獲。","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_144","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"宮人生二女：","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_65_145","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_65","textTraditional":"俱為金人所獲。","sentenceOrder":145}],"overrides":{}}